# Config-change hook: core runs every script in rc.syshook.d/config/ after a
# config save (Config::save -> syslog config-event -> configd
# system.event.config_changed -> rc.syshook config). Re-assert the managed
# tunnels' IPv6 addresses and next-hop routes, and the default-route guard,
# as soon as a save changes a tunnel's parts rather than at the next cron
# minute. Idempotent and silent unless it repairs something, so the plugin's
# own saves do not loop. Writes no config.

/usr/local/opnsense/scripts/OPNsense/WGIPv6Gateway/wgipv6gw.sh reconcile
exit 0
